# Ignore the OCR working corpus: it contains real member names and phone numbers
# from the screenshots and must not be published. Keep it local (see docs/README.md).
ocr/
merged/

# Phase 2 reference corpus: stitched screenshots, OCR text and the generated specs
# all contain real names, phone numbers and account balances from the observed
# product (hard rule 6). They stay on the workstation; only metadata is committed.
docs/audit/wakandi-stitched/
docs/audit/wakandi-ocr.json
docs/audit/wakandi-spec/

